WEBVTT

00:13.790 --> 00:16.730
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:17.920 --> 00:20.570
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.570 --> 00:25.980
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.450 --> 00:31.000
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.550 --> 00:35.840
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:36.800 --> 00:40.350
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.340 --> 00:43.550
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.550 --> 00:46.590
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.590 --> 00:48.670
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.670 --> 00:52.730
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.240 --> 00:58.010
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.010 --> 01:02.300
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.300 --> 01:03.710
♪Over the time♪

01:03.710 --> 01:05.720
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:05.720 --> 01:08.570
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.570 --> 01:11.840
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:11.840 --> 01:16.539
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.240 --> 01:24.890
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.560 --> 01:42.920
=Sword and Fairy=

01:44.520 --> 01:46.330
=Episode 35=

01:55.590 --> 01:57.350
Jinzhao, you are badly injured.

01:58.350 --> 01:58.990
Don't worry.

01:59.670 --> 02:00.830
I won't die so easily.

02:06.350 --> 02:08.470
Zhu Yu is trying to reestablish
the connection with Mist Soul.

02:09.910 --> 02:10.789
We can't let her succeed.

02:11.510 --> 02:12.230
Otherwise,

02:13.030 --> 02:15.190
so many people would have died in vain.

02:19.310 --> 02:19.910
Qi,

02:21.910 --> 02:23.310
everyone is waiting for us.

02:24.590 --> 02:26.150
Everyone is waiting for us.

02:28.550 --> 02:29.230
Jinzhao,

02:30.070 --> 02:30.750
leave it to me.

02:46.230 --> 02:46.829
Give up.

02:48.150 --> 02:49.750
You can't possibly beat me.

02:54.430 --> 02:55.150
(My thought)

02:55.870 --> 02:57.070
(is about my duty as a sword-wielder.)

02:58.110 --> 02:59.070
(I have understood)

03:00.910 --> 03:01.710
(that my thought)

03:02.630 --> 03:03.790
(is about the people
who risk their lives)

03:04.030 --> 03:05.270
(for the justice of mankind.)

03:07.610 --> 03:10.430
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

03:11.450 --> 03:14.170
♪Let go of all regrets♪

03:14.170 --> 03:19.190
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

03:21.240 --> 03:24.920
♪Deciding to let down my guard♪

03:24.920 --> 03:29.230
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

03:29.310 --> 03:29.950
(My thought)

03:30.829 --> 03:32.030
(is about my unyielding companions)

03:32.510 --> 03:33.990
(who forge ahead courageously.)

03:35.260 --> 03:37.110
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

03:37.110 --> 03:40.500
♪No regrets arise even if it's moving♪

03:40.500 --> 03:42.170
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

03:43.110 --> 03:43.790
(My thought)

03:44.550 --> 03:45.829
(is one thought in one life)

03:46.270 --> 03:47.270
(and one thought for one person.)

03:47.910 --> 03:49.630
(It's an ever-constant affection.)

03:52.250 --> 03:55.800
♪I pray for a miracle♪

03:55.990 --> 03:57.460
♪Over the time♪

03:57.829 --> 03:58.550
(My thought)

03:59.310 --> 04:00.670
(is also about the hustling world)

04:01.510 --> 04:02.430
(and every person in it)

04:02.710 --> 04:04.390
(who seems insignificant
but lives strongly.)

04:05.850 --> 04:09.010
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

04:10.970 --> 04:17.700
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

04:18.100 --> 04:20.209
♪I will protect you in my life♪

04:20.209 --> 04:25.680
♪That's my love for you♪

04:29.070 --> 04:29.750
Qi.

04:31.870 --> 04:33.850
♪I will protect you in my life♪

04:33.850 --> 04:37.210
♪That's my love for you♪

05:09.150 --> 05:09.590
Qi,

05:12.430 --> 05:12.790
come.

05:37.710 --> 05:38.470
My daughter,

05:42.270 --> 05:44.230
do you really want to kill your mother?

06:11.390 --> 06:11.910
Qi!

06:14.270 --> 06:15.270
What have you done to her?

06:51.710 --> 06:53.750
Qi, wake up quickly.

06:54.190 --> 06:55.430
Don't be deceived by her.

07:27.150 --> 07:27.750
Qi,

07:28.830 --> 07:29.910
you must wake up.

07:30.910 --> 07:32.350
Everyone is waiting for you.

07:33.790 --> 07:35.070
You have to wake up.

08:54.550 --> 08:56.030
(This is Zhu Yu's sea of awareness.)

08:57.630 --> 08:58.950
I won't be confused by you.

09:41.150 --> 09:41.790
Zhu Yu.

09:49.910 --> 09:50.430
Qi,

09:52.390 --> 09:53.670
you did very well.

10:28.150 --> 10:29.110
(Your name)

10:30.350 --> 10:31.110
(is called Qi.)

10:32.270 --> 10:33.070
(Qi)

10:33.670 --> 10:34.990
(means "pray".)

10:36.390 --> 10:38.110
(I hope you'll be happy and safe)

10:39.110 --> 10:40.230
(and that all is well for you.)

10:57.750 --> 10:58.670
Mother.

11:48.270 --> 11:48.910
Xian Qing.

11:53.750 --> 11:54.390
Xian Qing?

11:59.710 --> 12:00.150
Xian Qing?

12:04.270 --> 12:04.870
Xian Qing?

12:07.230 --> 12:07.750
Xian Qing?

12:09.950 --> 12:10.430
Xian Qing?

12:12.150 --> 12:12.750
Xian Qing?

12:23.790 --> 12:24.310
Xian Qing?

12:25.950 --> 12:26.510
Xian Qing?

12:31.270 --> 12:31.950
Xian Qing.

12:39.670 --> 12:40.550
Xian Qing.

12:45.630 --> 12:46.350
Xian Qing...

12:49.390 --> 12:50.870
If you continue to cry like this,

12:51.430 --> 12:53.270
you're going to drench my fur.

12:53.270 --> 12:53.830
Xian Qing?

12:55.870 --> 12:56.630
Xian Qing?

12:58.790 --> 12:59.590
Xian Qing!

13:05.750 --> 13:07.310
I promised you I would not die,

13:08.670 --> 13:09.950
so I definitely won't.

13:19.430 --> 13:20.590
I can't catch my breath.

13:23.110 --> 13:23.630
I'm sorry.

13:24.110 --> 13:24.710
I'm sorry.

13:53.350 --> 13:53.870
(Did they)

13:55.150 --> 13:55.870
(succeed?)

14:17.750 --> 14:19.550
Jinzhao, you...

14:20.590 --> 14:21.270
I'm fine.

14:25.510 --> 14:26.190
I'm really fine.

14:27.990 --> 14:28.390
Qi,

14:29.910 --> 14:30.390
it's over.

14:32.270 --> 14:32.710
Smile.

14:43.510 --> 14:44.110
Jinzhao,

14:45.590 --> 14:47.670
My Thought Sword
originates from my thoughts.

14:48.670 --> 14:49.830
I've changed my thoughts.

14:50.550 --> 14:52.150
So the power of Thought Sword
has changed too.

14:54.070 --> 14:55.030
Zhu Yu fell asleep.

14:57.710 --> 14:58.590
We did it.

15:03.190 --> 15:04.670
You found a way to make it work.

15:05.390 --> 15:06.670
You fulfilled a sword-wielder's duty.

15:31.710 --> 15:32.150
Qi,

15:34.070 --> 15:35.190
it's the Qixi Festival.

15:37.230 --> 15:38.150
Let's go to Jing'an.

15:40.230 --> 15:40.710
Okay.

15:41.790 --> 15:42.790
Let's go to Jing'an.

16:38.270 --> 16:38.910
Miss Ming?

16:39.270 --> 16:40.030
Xiu.

16:47.350 --> 16:48.070
We are here.

17:06.109 --> 17:07.349
I'll take you home.

17:26.790 --> 17:27.550
I know

17:29.070 --> 17:30.350
you are worried about Xiaoyuan,

17:31.150 --> 17:32.190
and you're sad and self-blaming.

17:35.750 --> 17:36.150
This

17:38.830 --> 17:39.830
is

17:42.550 --> 17:45.150
the first time you've held me.

17:57.390 --> 17:58.510
Although...

18:01.910 --> 18:03.710
Although the world

18:04.990 --> 18:06.110
thinks

18:07.950 --> 18:09.990
you are cold and heartless,

18:13.350 --> 18:14.150
I

18:16.030 --> 18:16.550
know

18:19.630 --> 18:20.870
very well

18:23.030 --> 18:23.910
that

18:26.270 --> 18:28.030
your heart

18:29.870 --> 18:30.670
is

18:31.990 --> 18:33.750
the warmest.

18:48.030 --> 18:48.670
Qingfei,

18:53.830 --> 18:55.190
I'll take you back
to the room for treatment.

19:39.710 --> 19:40.270
Qingfei?

19:53.950 --> 19:54.430
Qingfei.

19:54.870 --> 19:56.270
Don't waste it.

19:58.950 --> 19:59.710
Xuwei,

20:01.990 --> 20:02.990
I hope

20:04.550 --> 20:05.670
that this time

20:07.270 --> 20:08.910
we will win.

20:10.510 --> 20:11.350
It's because

20:12.870 --> 20:14.070
we have already

20:15.150 --> 20:16.950
given too much.

20:19.310 --> 20:20.150
I hope

20:23.630 --> 20:24.910
that when all this

20:26.470 --> 20:27.670
is over,

20:30.590 --> 20:33.350
you can really let go

20:34.670 --> 20:36.430
of the heavy burden on you,

20:38.510 --> 20:39.870
and together...

20:42.110 --> 20:43.670
Together...

20:55.070 --> 20:55.510
Qingfei?

20:58.110 --> 20:59.230
Don't fall asleep, Qingfei.

21:04.390 --> 21:05.310
(If you fall asleep,)

21:06.750 --> 21:09.030
(it might be hard for you
to wake up again.)

21:26.390 --> 21:26.990
(Jinzhao,)

21:28.350 --> 21:30.070
(it seems we have done something)

21:30.190 --> 21:31.270
(quite remarkable together.)

21:32.510 --> 21:33.150
(Of course.)

21:34.870 --> 21:36.390
(Peace has been restored to the world.)

21:37.190 --> 21:38.070
And the common people

21:38.990 --> 21:40.710
can now live happily ever after.

21:42.910 --> 21:43.790
Qi,

21:45.470 --> 21:47.750
what do you want to do in the future?

21:48.230 --> 21:51.710
Of course, to continue adventuring
through jianghu with you.

21:52.830 --> 21:54.190
Now we have money.

21:54.630 --> 21:55.230
In the future,

21:55.390 --> 21:57.670
we can have egg noodles
with lots of eggs.

21:59.910 --> 22:00.870
You only care about eating.

22:03.590 --> 22:04.230
Qi,

22:06.990 --> 22:08.870
in the future,
you will see many landscapes

22:11.030 --> 22:12.230
and meet many people.

22:13.910 --> 22:15.390
You should always remain this happy.

22:18.550 --> 22:19.710
If we get tired,

22:20.310 --> 22:21.990
we can rest on Mount Yuqing

22:22.750 --> 22:24.230
and visit Ming Xiu and Mr. Gu.

22:25.190 --> 22:26.350
If we get cold,

22:27.150 --> 22:28.910
we can visit Zhaoyan and Xian Qing.

22:29.550 --> 22:31.990
Xian Qing's wolf fur must be very warm.

22:41.110 --> 22:41.910
Qi,

22:44.190 --> 22:45.710
I want to eat candied haws.

22:47.070 --> 22:48.590
I used to always buy them for you.

22:49.670 --> 22:50.390
Can you

22:52.390 --> 22:53.990
buy them for me once today?

23:00.750 --> 23:01.150
Okay.

23:01.630 --> 23:02.430
I'll buy them for you.

23:03.070 --> 23:03.830
Wait here for me.

23:04.470 --> 23:04.910
Okay.

23:42.870 --> 23:43.390
Alright.

23:48.220 --> 23:52.220
♪Autumn comes and spring goes.
Eventually they fall♪

23:54.040 --> 23:58.360
♪The sun rises and the moon sets♪

23:59.030 --> 24:03.770
♪Giving you a gentle answer♪

24:06.710 --> 24:08.730
♪Under the sycamore tree♪

24:09.880 --> 24:11.770
♪The rain is spattering♪

24:13.020 --> 24:17.630
♪Breaking off a branch
to exchange for the memories♪

24:18.750 --> 24:23.410
♪Like threads weaving misty rain
into a painting♪

24:23.740 --> 24:28.890
♪Forming a bond
reminiscent of a rainbow♪

24:28.890 --> 24:34.960
♪I promise you a lifetime
of joy and yearning♪

24:34.960 --> 24:40.620
♪Burying your past
in the hustle and bustle♪

24:41.430 --> 24:47.570
♪I'll accompany you
through ups and downs♪

24:47.570 --> 24:53.690
♪Don't be afraid♪

24:53.690 --> 24:59.480
♪Writing about your struggle♪

24:59.860 --> 25:05.730
♪Being irrational and silly
because of you♪

25:05.730 --> 25:12.030
♪Betting your whole life♪

25:12.030 --> 25:18.060
♪No answer, no giving up♪

25:32.390 --> 25:33.190
Qingfei?

25:34.550 --> 25:35.110
Qingfei?

27:00.270 --> 27:01.150
Qingfei,

27:03.390 --> 27:04.790
wake up quickly.

27:08.030 --> 27:11.510
I don't have much time left.

29:09.230 --> 29:09.950
This is...

29:10.590 --> 29:11.510
A birthday gift.

29:14.350 --> 29:16.470
These two seem to be one.

29:20.120 --> 29:21.620
♪The sorrowful wind♪

29:21.620 --> 29:24.020
♪And the falling snow♪

29:24.590 --> 29:25.230
Jinzhao,

29:25.950 --> 29:27.310
I will stay with you forever.

29:31.420 --> 29:35.120
♪I can't be without you♪

29:35.710 --> 29:40.330
♪Take away my frail life♪

29:41.210 --> 29:45.700
♪Like a flower's reflection in a mirror♪

29:46.870 --> 29:52.170
♪Like a clear and icy cold crystal♪

29:53.750 --> 29:55.750
♪With the lightest whisper♪

29:55.750 --> 29:58.090
♪You make the harshest decision♪

29:58.090 --> 30:04.990
♪It's not different
from the extreme penalty♪

30:07.230 --> 30:12.060
♪If you really have the heart
to leave me alone♪

30:13.110 --> 30:17.430
♪Why do I see tears
shimmering in your eyes♪

30:17.510 --> 30:19.150
There, now the pendants
are a matching pair.

30:20.350 --> 30:20.790
From now on,

30:22.470 --> 30:23.470
no matter what happens,

30:25.710 --> 30:27.310
I will always be by your side

30:28.790 --> 30:29.550
and face it together.

30:30.040 --> 30:34.320
♪If it's all fate♪

30:35.710 --> 30:40.540
♪Don't question who has betrayed love♪

30:40.950 --> 30:43.630
♪If there's no hope for a reunion♪

30:43.630 --> 30:47.480
♪Don't eavesdrop on me in the dream♪

30:47.740 --> 30:52.360
♪Singing my yearning♪

30:55.390 --> 30:56.350
Ming Xiu.

30:58.190 --> 30:59.030
What are you doing?

31:02.070 --> 31:02.990
I was thinking

31:03.590 --> 31:05.750
that it's Jinzhao's and my birthday,

31:06.630 --> 31:07.750
and we should eat egg noodles.

31:10.310 --> 31:11.670
Yue Jinzhao is already dead.

31:14.510 --> 31:16.510
You've already said that many times.

31:18.270 --> 31:19.230
But do you really understand

31:19.550 --> 31:21.750
what death means?

31:23.710 --> 31:25.470
Death is the loss of life.

31:26.350 --> 31:27.950
It's when the soul leaves the body.

31:29.350 --> 31:31.870
It's something that everyone
ultimately experiences.

31:33.710 --> 31:35.030
Then repeat after me.

31:36.150 --> 31:37.470
Yue Jinzhao is already dead.

31:39.230 --> 31:40.750
Yue Jinzhao is already dead.

31:41.270 --> 31:42.270
Say it again.

31:42.990 --> 31:44.190
Jinzhao is already dead.

31:44.270 --> 31:45.070
Again.

31:50.390 --> 31:51.390
I don't want to.

31:51.790 --> 31:53.510
Yue Jinzhao is already dead!

31:54.110 --> 31:54.630
Miss Ming,

31:56.190 --> 31:56.910
stop.

32:05.350 --> 32:06.270
If she can't accept

32:06.390 --> 32:08.070
the fact that her loved one
has passed away,

32:09.190 --> 32:10.630
how is she supposed to go on living?

32:12.710 --> 32:13.670
Even the one we thought

32:13.750 --> 32:15.470
would always spoil her is gone.

32:16.390 --> 32:18.990
How much longer can we accompany her?

32:22.110 --> 32:23.190
If, one day,

32:23.670 --> 32:24.710
we are no longer here,

32:26.430 --> 32:27.590
what is she to do?

32:49.390 --> 32:50.070
Miss Yue...

32:50.470 --> 32:51.710
Jinzhao has already died.

32:53.190 --> 32:53.830
I know.

32:57.550 --> 32:59.630
Doesn't everyone ultimately die anyway?

33:04.270 --> 33:05.270
Why don't you get some sleep?

33:31.350 --> 33:32.150
Jinzhao,

33:32.910 --> 33:34.030
I'm so hungry.

33:57.110 --> 33:58.150
Didn't you want to eat noodles?

34:00.070 --> 34:02.190
Today is your birthday. Eat up.

34:25.590 --> 34:26.350
Don't they taste good?

34:31.389 --> 34:31.909
That's good.

34:32.870 --> 34:34.870
We were worried
they wouldn't suit your taste.

34:36.310 --> 34:37.270
They are tasty.

34:38.710 --> 34:41.190
I've never had noodles
this delicious before.

34:42.670 --> 34:43.790
The noodles are soft

34:44.909 --> 34:45.790
yet not mushy.

34:48.510 --> 34:50.270
The first time Jinzhao cooked noodles,

34:51.070 --> 34:52.469
he cooked them for so long

34:53.270 --> 34:54.909
that they nearly turned into porridge.

34:56.110 --> 34:57.670
Later, when he cooked noodles,

34:58.670 --> 34:59.910
they were always undercooked.

35:04.550 --> 35:05.990
And the vegetable leaves are green.

35:09.830 --> 35:11.190
The noodles Jinzhao cooked for me

35:11.950 --> 35:13.990
had yellow vegetable leaves in them.

35:15.430 --> 35:17.110
I said they wouldn't taste good
like that.

35:18.750 --> 35:20.390
The next time he served me noodles,

35:21.270 --> 35:24.070
he just quickly
blanched the vegetable leaves.

35:30.150 --> 35:31.830
This egg is still runny in the center.

35:34.550 --> 35:36.630
This is my favorite way to eat eggs.

35:38.710 --> 35:40.830
But Jinzhao never cooked them
like this for me.

35:41.630 --> 35:42.430
He said

35:43.190 --> 35:44.630
he was afraid
it'd give me a stomach ache.

35:47.070 --> 35:48.910
I think he just didn't know
how to cook them.

36:07.310 --> 36:08.110
What's wrong?

36:11.990 --> 36:12.750
Nothing.

36:13.230 --> 36:15.430
I just ate too quickly.

36:15.710 --> 36:16.910
I feel a bit uncomfortable.

36:17.630 --> 36:18.430
Then stop eating them.

36:18.430 --> 36:19.030
No.

36:19.630 --> 36:21.630
Jinzhao told me not to waste food.

36:28.830 --> 36:29.790
They are really delicious.

36:36.790 --> 36:37.550
I've finished.

36:40.190 --> 36:41.990
There's something
on the corner of your mouth.

36:47.870 --> 36:49.430
On the left corner.

36:53.980 --> 36:57.110
♪Unfelt sensations♪

36:57.620 --> 37:00.910
♪What seemed eternal♪

37:01.180 --> 37:06.370
♪Turned out to be the most fleeting♪

37:08.670 --> 37:09.870
Slow down.

37:12.510 --> 37:15.390
♪The more we desperately try to keep♪

37:15.470 --> 37:17.630
Look at you. Your mouth is so dirty.

37:17.990 --> 37:19.430
What if I'm not around?

37:22.270 --> 37:25.230
♪Vows are said to burn to ash♪

37:26.510 --> 37:28.670
So this is what death is like.

37:29.140 --> 37:32.230
♪Why do sudden memories
overflow into tears♪

37:32.310 --> 37:33.270
It means that person

37:35.910 --> 37:37.350
is gone forever.

37:43.030 --> 37:44.710
When Shifang died,

37:46.590 --> 37:48.950
I felt like there was a hole
in my heart.

37:51.710 --> 37:53.470
After Zhu Yu fell asleep,

37:55.430 --> 37:57.990
I felt the hole in my heart
grow even larger.

38:00.510 --> 38:01.710
But now,

38:03.710 --> 38:06.790
it feels like
I don't even have a heart anymore.

38:10.000 --> 38:12.930
♪Vows are said to burn to ash♪

38:15.830 --> 38:18.590
He would never call me a fool again.

38:19.310 --> 38:21.950
He would never pat me on the head

38:23.230 --> 38:25.910
or call me Qi again.

38:28.070 --> 38:29.510
If you're sad, just have a good cry.

38:32.830 --> 38:34.230
Jinzhao is no longer here.

38:35.350 --> 38:37.150
Who am I supposed to cry for?

38:59.390 --> 39:00.030
Zhaoyan,

39:00.750 --> 39:01.470
Ming Xiu,

39:04.070 --> 39:04.830
look.

39:05.510 --> 39:06.790
I'm not crying anymore.

39:14.910 --> 39:17.030
Thank you for celebrating my birthday.

39:18.470 --> 39:19.230
These past few days,

39:20.230 --> 39:21.630
I have caused you trouble.

39:24.830 --> 39:26.350
You two should rest first.

39:27.630 --> 39:28.990
I'm going to see Ying Xuwei.

39:44.270 --> 39:44.990
She should

39:47.150 --> 39:49.230
be stronger than we thought, right?

39:50.670 --> 39:51.990
But I am a bit afraid.

40:37.950 --> 40:38.830
Are you crying?

40:42.630 --> 40:43.670
I'm not.

40:47.350 --> 40:48.510
Your eyes are all swollen.

40:49.790 --> 40:50.110
That...

40:50.630 --> 40:52.470
That is because
I didn't sleep well last night.

40:53.110 --> 40:53.710
Besides,

40:54.350 --> 40:55.830
your eyes are much more swollen
than mine.

40:56.910 --> 40:58.110
I also cried just now.

40:59.830 --> 41:01.030
I don't want to talk to you.

41:01.670 --> 41:02.270
Xiaoyuan.

41:04.390 --> 41:05.510
Am I very familiar with you?

41:05.910 --> 41:06.990
Call me Leader Qili.

41:08.750 --> 41:10.030
Once you've cried,
you shouldn't cry again.

41:11.030 --> 41:11.830
You need to grow up.

41:12.710 --> 41:14.190
What's so good about growing up?

41:14.670 --> 41:16.550
Xuwei and Qingfei
are both so badly injured.

41:17.070 --> 41:18.510
Luohuan is even dead.

41:21.190 --> 41:22.990
No one can stay a child forever.

41:26.150 --> 41:28.350
If someone could always remain a child,

41:31.630 --> 41:33.910
it's because someone else
is bearing the burdens

41:37.750 --> 41:38.830
that she should carry for her.

41:40.350 --> 41:41.510
I don't need you to tell me that.

41:53.550 --> 41:54.110
(Yue Qi,)

41:54.790 --> 41:55.790
(I want the power of Rehai.)

42:23.460 --> 42:24.860
♪Stars twinkle♪

42:24.860 --> 42:26.860
♪Falling on the lake's surface♪

42:27.660 --> 42:28.860
♪The bright moon gleams♪

42:28.860 --> 42:30.860
♪Illuminating your tender eyes♪

42:31.560 --> 42:33.770
♪Hearing the soft heartbeat by my side♪

42:33.770 --> 42:37.870
♪I make a wish deep within♪

42:39.860 --> 42:41.110
♪Flowers sway gently♪

42:41.110 --> 42:43.200
♪Our eyes are full of affection♪

42:43.200 --> 42:45.120
♪In a low murmur♪

42:45.120 --> 42:47.120
♪We express
our entwined hearts' desires♪

42:47.120 --> 42:50.550
♪Joyfully going
through the endless years♪

42:50.550 --> 42:52.820
♪A breeze stirs the heartstrings♪

42:52.820 --> 42:55.320
♪Red thread twines around fingers♪

42:55.320 --> 42:57.170
♪We've witnessed blossoms♪

42:57.170 --> 42:59.170
♪And braved through snow storms♪

42:59.170 --> 43:03.190
♪Each moment is hard to forget♪

43:03.190 --> 43:05.880
♪The joys, the innocence,
the fearlessness♪

43:05.880 --> 43:08.340
♪And our very images♪

43:08.340 --> 43:10.340
♪All carefully cherished♪

43:10.340 --> 43:13.430
♪I wish to stand side by side with you♪

43:13.430 --> 43:15.760
♪To watch the sun rise and fall♪

43:15.760 --> 43:17.460
♪And the seasons change♪

43:17.460 --> 43:20.280
♪When the wind kisses us softly♪

43:20.280 --> 43:22.280
♪We snuggle and cuddle♪

43:22.600 --> 43:26.610
♪And you embrace me in your dream♪

43:26.610 --> 43:29.650
♪I wish to hold your hand♪

43:29.650 --> 43:32.310
♪Inviting a spring breeze to become♪

43:32.310 --> 43:33.590
♪An eternal pledge♪

43:33.590 --> 43:36.760
♪I wish the wind could hear♪

43:36.760 --> 43:39.670
♪Our loyalty and love for each other♪

43:39.670 --> 43:41.430
♪It's my wish♪

43:41.430 --> 43:44.440
♪And my sole wish for this life♪

